{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17411","headline":"顺宗至德大安孝皇帝挽歌三首 二 · 权德舆","name":"顺宗至德大安孝皇帝挽歌三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孝理本忧勤，玄功在啬神。\n睿图传上嗣，寿酒比家人。\n仙驭三清远，行宫万象新。\n小臣司吉从，还扈属车尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}